  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/nh-rsa-data/blob/96bd0a247d4463e2ae692310c0fdd17ec563a46c/rsa_html/VI/99/99-8.htm",
  "statuteText": "99:8 Increases for Recruitment Purposes. –\n\nUpon request of the appointing authority, the governor and council are hereby authorized and empowered, notwithstanding any other provisions of the law to the contrary, upon a finding by them and a recommendation from the director of personnel that a an increase in pay is needed for successful recruitment of qualified personnel in any job title therefor, to increase pay of such classified positions, any such increases to be a charge against the pay adjustment fund."
